# Pairs with NoKeyLost. The split moves the map without its final
# authoritative drain, so a write the source acknowledged before the freeze is
# missing from the destination the map now routes to.
MODULE: NoKeyLostRetainedCommitSkipsDrain
TARGET: NoKeyLost
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the split moves the map without its final drain, so the destination misses an acknowledged write
PERTURBS: SplitCommit

--- FIND
       IN row' = [x \in Copies |-> [s \in Shards |-> [k \in Keys |->
                     IF k = k2 /\ s = s2 /\ (x = c \/ (x = R /\ ResizeMirrors(c, s2)))
                     THEN Max(row[x][s][k], v) ELSE row[x][s][k]]]]
    /\ alias = spCopy
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no final drain before ReassignSlotsAsync.
       IN UNCHANGED row
    /\ alias = spCopy
--- END
